      "title": "The Silence of the Lambs (film) - Wikipedia",
      "snippet": "The Silence of the Lambs is a 1991 American psychological horror thriller film directed by Jonathan Demme and written by Ted Tally, adapted from Thomas Harris 's 1988 novel. It stars Jodie Foster as Clarice Starling, a young FBI trainee who is hunting a serial killer known as \"Buffalo Bill\" (Ted Levine), who skins his female victims.",
