      "title": "The Silence of the Lambs movie review - Roger Ebert",
      "snippet": "The secret of \" Silence \" is that it doesn't start with the cannibal-it arrives at him, through the eyes and minds of a young woman. \"Silence of the Lambs\" is the story of Clarice Starling, the FBI trainee played by Jodie Foster, and the story follows her without substantial interruption. Dr.",
